      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Combo:\n    0-3: self\n      4: A\n      5: B\n      6: C\n\n0: ADV: A = trunc(A / 2**combo)\n1: BXL: B ^= o\n2: BST: B = combo % 8\n3: JNZ: A == 0 ? jmp(o) : idx++\n4: BXC: B ^= C\n5: OUT: combo % 8\n6: BDV: B = trunc(A / 2**combo)\n7: CDV: C = trunc(A / 2**combo)",
